✅ Positive Test Cases – Withdrawals & Winnings
💰 Winnings and Balance
Verify the correct winning amount is displayed after the contest ends.
Verify the winning amount is added to the user’s available balance after contest completion.
Verify the available cash balance updates immediately after withdrawal.
Verify the wallet reflects the deducted withdrawal amount correctly.
Verify the wallet reflects remaining bonus and winnings separately.

💸 Withdrawals Functionality
Verify the user can successfully withdraw a valid amount above the minimum threshold.
Verify a withdrawal request is processed correctly when valid bank account details are available.
Verify the withdrawal fee (₹10) is deducted properly and shown clearly in the transaction summary.
Verify the withdrawal summary shows a breakdown: requested amount, taxes, fees, and final payout.
Verify the system allows withdrawing to the selected verified bank account.
Verify that the user receives a confirmation or success message after initiating withdrawal.
Verify the user receives a transaction ID or reference number for tracking.

🏦 Bank Information and Validation
Verify the user can successfully add valid bank details (account holder name, number, IFSC, branch).
Verify that the bank name dropdown displays and allows selection from valid bank names.
Verify valid account numbers with leading or trailing zeros are accepted.
Verify that valid IFSC codes are accepted and saved.
Verify users can save and edit their bank details when necessary.
Verify that bank details are retained and prefilled during the next withdrawal attempt.
Verify a success message appears after bank details are saved.

🧪 Additional Functional Validations
Verify the user is able to withdraw full available winnings amount if above the minimum.
Verify the withdrawal method (e.g., UPI, Net Banking) is selectable and functional.
Verify a notification or email is sent after successful withdrawal initiation.
Verify user can view withdrawal history under “Transactions” or “Wallet History”.
Verify the system handles multiple sequential withdrawals gracefully.

💰 Winnings and Cash Balance - Negative Test cases
Verify the winning amount is displayed accurately after the contest ends.
Verify the available cash balance is updated correctly after contest results.

💸 Withdrawals
Verify that entering 0 in the withdrawal field displays an appropriate validation error.
Verify that users cannot withdraw money without adding a bank account.
Verify that bonus amounts cannot be withdrawn.
Verify the amount field by entering alphabetic characters (e.g., "five hundred").
Verify the amount field by entering special characters (e.g., @#$%^).
Verify the system prevents withdrawal of amounts below the minimum limit.
Verify the system prevents withdrawal of amounts exceeding the available balance.
Verify that applicable taxes are correctly deducted at the time of withdrawal.
Verify that the standard withdrawal fee of ₹10 is applied correctly.
Verify whether users are allowed to skip the “Standard Withdrawal” process.

🏦 Bank Details Validation
Verify that all bank names are listed in the dropdown.
Verify that bank names are displayed in alphabetical order.
Verify that the selected bank name is correctly shown in the field.
Verify entering numeric values in the bank branch name field is restricted.
Verify entering special characters in the bank branch name field is not allowed.
Verify the bank branch name field accepts only valid string input.
Verify entering numeric characters in the account holder's name field shows an error.
Verify special characters are not allowed in the account number field.
Verify valid account numbers with leading zeros are accepted.
Verify IFSC code validation by entering incorrect or malformed codes.
Verify that once all bank details are added, the data is saved successfully.
Verify boundary values for the account number field (e.g., too short or too long).
